          "id": "75ec3bd4-d797-4367-99b4-f147d36a2b24",
          "name": "Proompty Update a specific prompt within a designated topic. Users can send a PUT request to this endpoint with the corresponding topicId and promptId parameters, along with a JSON payload containing the updated prompt information. This enables users to modify aspects of the prompt such as its content, metadata, or any other relevant properties. Upon successful execution, the endpoint responds with the updated prompt object in JSON format, providing confirmation of the changes made. In case the specified prompt or topic is not found, the endpoint returns an appropriate error response (404 for prompt not found, 500 for other errors), ensuring transparent communication and accurate handling of requests.",
